menu "E-Paper 1.54 Example"

    config EXAMPLE_EPD_4GRAY
        bool "Use 4-gray mode (full refresh only)"
        default n
        help
            Drive the GDEY0154D67 panel in 4-gray mode using the OTP 4-gray
            waveform. Text uses 2 bpp anti-aliased fonts and images are dithered
            between 4 gray levels. Partial refresh is not available in this mode,
            every update is a full refresh.

endmenu
